Package: bwTools
Type: Package
Title: Native R Tools for BigWig, WIG, and bedGraph Files
Version: 0.3.2
Authors@R: person("Rensc", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "rensc0718@163.com")
Description: Provides native R implementations for reading and writing local
    BigWig files, constructing and querying BigWig zoom summaries, calculating
    interval statistics, and reading and writing WIG and bedGraph signal tracks.
    BigWig binary I/O uses base R random-access operations, binary encoding, and
    zlib compression without bundled C or C++ code or external UCSC executables.
    Signal objects follow the BwgTrack data contract used by GeneTrackR for
    direct downstream interoperability.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: data.table
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
NeedsCompilation: no
